OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,9,     GPetroc Trelawny with three hours
OL,10,     Gof classical music to reflect,
OL,11,     Grestore and refresh, whether
OL,12,     Gyou're hunkering down with a book
OL,13,     Gor heading for a walk in the
OL,14,     Ghills.
OL,15,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,16,     GTV presenter Peter Purves shares
OL,17,     Ghis musical passions with Michael
OL,18,     GBerkeley, and talks about his
OL,19,     Gcareer on Blue Peter, Doctor Who
OL,20,     Gand Crufts.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
