OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 18 JAN
OL,4,G1330FMusic Map
OL,5,     GBruch's Violin Concerto No.1 is
OL,6,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch's destination
OL,7,     Gon today's Music Map. Along with
OL,8,     Gway, she travels via Bach,
OL,9,     GStravinsky and Stephane Grappelli.
OL,10,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GFrom St Lawrence Church, York,
OL,12,     Gwith the Ebor Singers, with music
OL,13,     Gby Richard Allain, Lucy Walker,
OL,14,     GBairstow and Buxtehude.
OL,15,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,16,     GJoin our community of jazz
OL,17,     Glovers. Alyn Shipton is waiting
OL,18,     Gfor your requests: email
OL,19,     Gjrr@bbc.co.uk or use
OL,20,     G_jazzrecordrequests on social.
